ngs.","attribution":"","source":"National Labor Relations Board (nlrb.gov), Weingarten Rights, retrieved Oct 12, 2026 (https://www.nlrb.gov/about-nlrb/rights-we-protect/your-rights/weingarten-rights); Legal Information Institute, Cornell Law School (law.cornell.edu), 29 U.S. Code 402 - Definitions (LMRDA), retrieved Oct 12, 2026 (https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/29/402); Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov), M.G.L. c. 150E, section 5A, retrieved Oct 12, 2026 (https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section5A); Legal Information Institute, Cornell Law School (law.cornell.edu), 29 U.S. Code 431 - Report of labor organizations, retrieved Oct 12, 2026 (https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/29/431)","rights_note":"owner-authored: Original plain-language text drafted for the platform; statutes, regulations, agency pages and court opinions are cited and paraphrased, short quotations only.","review_note":"source review, 2026-10-12T07:41:37Z: Fresh-context verification pass: every claim read against its verbatim source quotes in context, Spanish checked against English, jurisdiction and affiliation guardrails checked. Not yet reviewed by the platform editor; editor review is required before publication.","bullets":[],"direction":"","topics":["faq","membership"],"audience":"all","tone":"","learning_outcome":"","factual_claims":true,"priority":0,"is_default":false},"provenance":{"content_path":"content/explainer-content/faq.json","unit_id":"faq-what-is-a-steward","locale":"en","record":{"provenance_id":"prov-25da50f7964da3cf38223933a4538061b435fafbb7cb961aac5f533010654630","source":{"url":"https://app.example.invalid/#faq-what-is-a-steward","publisher":"Union Ground platform content (authored draft)","title":"What is a steward?","document_date":"2026-10-12"},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:08Z","content_sha256":"d7da95f81227d3b02a00cd2c346e27a2a1626f5e40b35083eb56392bafc74c2a","capture":{"method":"authored"},"extraction":{"met