r-janus-qa","provenance":{"provenance_id":"prov-c903fcab77e757f1559444092413acbfe9fc207cd2e13125b166275e66d3debc","source":{"url":"https://www.mass.gov/info-details/dlr-qa-re-janus-v-american-fed-of-state-cty-muni-employees","publisher":"Massachusetts Department of Labor Relations (mass.gov)","title":"DLR Q&A re: Janus v. AFSCME","document_date":null},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:09:24Z","content_sha256":"be82dac0fc704fa097700b92f1fe4f77ac9a8dc2af1ef8470b0d8dc14376d3c8","capture":{"method":"firecrawl"},"extraction":{"method":"verbatim","extractor":"public source capture text view","quote_binding":"exact-substring"},"as_of":"2026-10-12","derived_from":[],"review":{"status":"unreviewed","reviewed_at":null,"reviewer_role":"content reviewer","note":""},"reuse":{"basis":"public-record","note":"Cited and paraphrased; not republished in full."}}}]}},{"id":"ad6a29e9-a0f7-578c-a9ff-c7f59950d425","payload":{"kind":"mini_lesson","locale":"es","locale_state":"reviewed","title":"Pedí dejar de pagar, pero me siguen descontando dinero del cheque. ¿Qué puedo hacer?","body":"El Departamento de Relaciones Laborales de Massachusetts (DLR) recomienda avisar por escrito tanto a su empleador como a su sindicato que usted quiere que los pagos se detengan. El DLR también dice que usted puede informarse sobre cómo presentar una queja por falta de pago de salario ante la División de Trabajo Justo (Fair Labor Division) de la Oficina del Procurador General de Massachusetts. Guarde copias de su aviso, de la autorización que firmó y de sus talones de pago. La guía del DLR trata sobre las cuotas de agencia después de Janus. Si usted es miembro y firmó una autorización de cuotas, también importan sus términos de revocación según la ley M.G.L. c. 180, sección 17A; pida a su delegado o delegada sindical o a la oficina del sindicato que la revise con usted.","attribution":"","source":"Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov), M.G.L. c. 180, section 17A, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXII/Chapter180/Section17A); Massachusetts Department of Labor Relations (mass.gov), DLR Q&A re: Janus v. AFSCME, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.mass.gov/info-details/dlr-qa-re-janus-v-american-fed-of-state-cty-muni-employees)","rights_note":"owner-authored: Original plain-language text drafted for the platform; statutes, regulations, agency pages and court opinions are cited and paraphrased, short quotations only.","review_note":"source review, 2026-10-12T07:41:37Z: Fresh-context verification pass: every claim read against its verbatim source quotes in context, Spanish checked against English, jurisdiction and affiliation guardrails checked. Not yet reviewed by the platform editor; editor review is required before publication.","bullets":[],"direction":"","topics":["faq","dues"],"audience":"all","tone":"","learning_outcome":"","factual_claims":true,"priority":0,"is_default":false},"provenance":{"content_path":"content/explainer-content/faq.json","unit_id":"faq-money-still-taken-after-i-stopped","locale":"es","record":{"provenance_id":"prov-260216c014acc319ec8d04c70156118570165bbe1880554c404b0ebb2a2b1e10","source":{"url":"https://app.example.invalid/#faq-money-still-taken-after-i-stopped","publisher":"Union Ground platform content (authored draft)","title":"I asked to stop paying, but money is still taken from my check. What can I do?","document_date":"2026-10-12"},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:08Z","content_sha256":"9f6ec50c67e580d852117a6e7a609d8b271e9333e47a3424ab2f259456202991","capture":{"method":"authored"},"extraction":{"method":"model","extractor":"bilingual draft generation, en+es; quotes checked by quotation validation","quote_binding":"exact-substring"},"as_of":"2026-10-12","derived_from":["prov-17cff664dffa35b5bbfdd7c4785d7040c1bf841748fc5e57610a0871dd00ab21","prov-c903fcab77e757f1559444092413acbfe9fc207cd2e13125b166275e66d3debc"],"review":{"status":"reviewed","reviewed_at":"2026-10-12T07:41:37Z","revi