","extractor":"public source capture text view","quote_binding":"exact-substring"},"as_of":"2026-10-12","derived_from":[],"review":{"status":"unreviewed","reviewed_at":null,"reviewer_role":"content reviewer","note":""},"reuse":{"basis":"public-record","note":"Cited and paraphrased; not republished in full."}}},{"source_key":"ma-150e-s11","provenance":{"provenance_id":"prov-d4990f7ba5c14c5bdad936818f6f8ca9730e5ee9d6e76caaf67c03a039b2ae7f","source":{"url":"https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section11","publisher":"Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov)","title":"M.G.L. c. 150E, section 11","document_date":null},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:04:46Z","content_sha256":"6ea055696317c50f44dc97d7259cefd302236184f44d5ac9d53fbdc50ac7436b","capture":{"method":"http-get"},"extraction":{"method":"verbatim","extractor":"public source capture text view","quote_binding":"exact-substring"},"as_of":"2026-10-12","derived_from":[],"review":{"status":"unreviewed","reviewed_at":null,"reviewer_role":"content reviewer","note":""},"reuse":{"basis":"public-record","note":"Cited and paraphrased; not republished in full."}}}]}},{"id":"84779ace-8602-5d9a-ae8b-4fc963b20594","payload":{"kind":"mini_lesson","locale":"es","locale_state":"reviewed","title":"¿Me puede castigar mi empleador por participar en actividades sindicales?","body":"No de manera legal. En el empleo público de Massachusetts, la ley c. 150E, sección 10, dice que es una práctica prohibida que el empleador discrimine en la contratación, la permanencia o cualquier condición de empleo para fomentar o desalentar la afiliación sindical. También está prohibido despedirlo o discriminarlo por presentar una queja, dar testimonio según la ley, o afiliarse o elegir ser representado por un sindicato. Si el Departamento de Relaciones Laborales (DLR) concluye que un empleado fue despedido o discriminado en violación de la ley, debe ordenar su reincorporación, con o sin pago retroactivo (back pay). La mayoría de los trabajadores del sector privado tienen una protección parecida según la National Labor Relations Act. Un cargo ante el DLR debe presentarse dentro de los seis meses, así que hable pronto con su delegado o delegada sindical.","attribution":"","source":"Massachusetts Department of Labor Relations (mass.gov), Public sector unfair labor practice charge, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.mass.gov/how-to/public-sector-unfair-labor-practice-charge); Legal Information Institute, Cornell Law School (law.cornell.edu), 29 U.S. Code 158 - Unfair labor practices, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/29/158); Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov), M.G.L. c. 150E, section 10, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section10); Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov), M.G.L. c. 150E, section 11, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section11)","rights_note":"owner-authored: Original plain-language text drafted for the platform; statutes, regulations, agency pages and court opinions are cited and paraphrased, short quotations only.","review_note":"source review, 2026-10-12T07:41:37Z: Fresh-context verification pass: every claim read against its verbatim source quotes in context, Spanish checked against English, jurisdiction and affiliation guardrails checked. Not yet reviewed by the platform editor; editor review is required before publication.","bullets":[],"direction":"","topics":["faq","rights-at-work"],"audience":"all","tone":"","learning_outcome":"","factual_claims":true,"priority":0,"is_default":false},"provenance":{"content_path":"content/explainer-content/faq.json","unit_id":"faq-can-i-be-punished-for-union-activity","locale":"es","record":{"provenance_id":"prov-a77269c48d3c60ecfba958dc6d76fe59b00466d035c42423b3b0c489cd033d8a","source":{"url":"https://app.example.invalid/#faq-can-i-be-punishe