","derived_from":[],"review":{"status":"unreviewed","reviewed_at":null,"reviewer_role":"content reviewer","note":""},"reuse":{"basis":"public-record","note":"Cited and paraphrased; not republished in full."}}},{"source_key":"dlr-c-arb-mediation","provenance":{"provenance_id":"prov-28a7806565901ce7eb42c9a4b7bf47afe709c5ef6ea4283c5345f08424626c8d","source":{"url":"https://www.mass.gov/info-details/c-arbitration-and-mediation-services","publisher":"Massachusetts Department of Labor Relations (mass.gov)","title":"C. Arbitration and Mediation Services","document_date":null},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:09:19Z","content_sha256":"88d732e76e15f49a67684e09163821c1874766ed51e770d043240988162e47ae","capture":{"method":"firecrawl"},"extraction":{"method":"verbatim","extractor":"public source capture text view","quote_binding":"exact-substring"},"as_of":"2026-10-12","derived_from":[],"review":{"status":"unreviewed","reviewed_at":null,"reviewer_role":"content reviewer","note":""},"reuse":{"basis":"public-record","note":"Cited and paraphrased; not republished in full."}}}]}},{"id":"82d62b7f-0f8a-5e78-aef7-02485cc23235","payload":{"kind":"mini_lesson","locale":"es","locale_state":"reviewed","title":"¿Qué pasa en cada paso de una queja formal?","body":"Su contrato fija los pasos, quién atiende cada uno y los plazos. En general, un procedimiento de quejas es un conjunto de reglas para documentar, presentar y resolver disputas laborales, y puede incluir negociación, mediación (mediation) o arbitraje (arbitration). En el empleo público de Massachusetts, un contrato puede incluir un procedimiento que termine en arbitraje final y obligatorio. El Departamento de Relaciones Laborales (DLR) también ofrece mediación de quejas, normalmente cuando el contrato lo prevé, aunque las partes también pueden acordar pedirla. Un mediador de quejas del DLR trata de ayudar a ambas partes a llegar a un acuerdo voluntario antes del arbitraje. Pida a su delegado o delegada sindical que le explique los pasos de su contrato.","attribution":"","source":"Legal Information Institute, Cornell Law School (law.cornell.edu), Wex: grievance, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.law.cornell.edu/wex/grievance); Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov), M.G.L. c. 150E, section 8, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section8); Massachusetts Department of Labor Relations (mass.gov), C. Arbitration and Mediation Services, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.mass.gov/info-details/c-arbitration-and-mediation-services)","rights_note":"owner-authored: Original plain-language text drafted for the platform; statutes, regulations, agency pages and court opinions are cited and paraphrased, short quotations only.","review_note":"source review, 2026-10-12T07:41:37Z: Fresh-context verification pass: every claim read against its verbatim source quotes in context, Spanish checked against English, jurisdiction and affiliation guardrails checked. Not yet reviewed by the platform editor; editor review is required before publication.","bullets":[],"direction":"","topics":["faq","grievances"],"audience":"all","tone":"","learning_outcome":"","factual_claims":true,"priority":0,"is_default":false},"provenance":{"content_path":"content/explainer-content/faq.json","unit_id":"faq-what-happens-at-each-grievance-step","locale":"es","record":{"provenance_id":"prov-ec3e682f6790cb35a9da597e300f87ea10862e85507cc1baa5d305eeeba2f218","source":{"url":"https://app.example.invalid/#faq-what-happens-at-each-grievance-step","publisher":"Union Ground platform content (authored draft)","title":"What happens at each step of a grievance?","document_date":"2026-10-12"},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:08Z","content_sha256":"7b4719b25a5b3c7961e8dccf2808da895c0e96815f70b7b8f455ea26000e9b57","capture":{"method":"authored"},"extraction":{"method":"model","extractor":"bilingual draft generation, en+es; quotes checked by quotation validation","quote_binding