l de administración de los tribunales y los alguaciles de condado, la solicitud va al gobernador. Si el gobernador no recomienda los fondos dentro de 45 días, la solicitud vuelve a las partes. Órgano legislativo incluye la Legislatura estatal (General Court), un concejo municipal o la asamblea del pueblo (town meeting).","attribution":"","source":"Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov), M.G.L. c. 150E, section 1, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section1); Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov), M.G.L. c. 150E, section 7, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section7)","rights_note":"owner-authored: Original plain-language text drafted for the platform; statutes, regulations, agency pages and court opinions are cited and paraphrased, short quotations only.","review_note":"source review, 2026-10-12T07:41:37Z: Fresh-context verification pass: every claim read against its verbatim source quotes in context, Spanish checked against English, jurisdiction and affiliation guardrails checked. Not yet reviewed by the platform editor; editor review is required before publication.","bullets":[],"direction":"","topics":["faq","bargaining"],"audience":"all","tone":"","learning_outcome":"","factual_claims":true,"priority":0,"is_default":false},"provenance":{"content_path":"content/explainer-content/faq.json","unit_id":"faq-who-approves-the-money-for-a-contract","locale":"es","record":{"provenance_id":"prov-c74608594605584f73c8adf8ceba590ec6e3fb64d600ae601514f9a59288b933","source":{"url":"https://app.example.invalid/#faq-who-approves-the-money-for-a-contract","publisher":"Union Ground platform content (authored draft)","title":"Who approves the money for a public-sector contract?","document_date":"2026-10-12"},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:08Z","content_sha256":"bd2b4c497560c1d8d85535ef63c5aa61aef98918621aa3e11b0e8fb4bc0f5010","capture":{"