ole":"content reviewer","note":""},"reuse":{"basis":"public-record","note":"Cited and paraphrased; not republished in full."}}},{"source_key":"nlrb-jurisdiction","provenance":{"provenance_id":"prov-f6747d339b89e2598ef558abac8732de8d10f7bcb8b99b2b1adab7c8531cbf4d","source":{"url":"https://www.nlrb.gov/about-nlrb/rights-we-protect/the-law/jurisdictional-standards","publisher":"National Labor Relations Board (nlrb.gov)","title":"Jurisdictional Standards","document_date":null},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:05:45Z","content_sha256":"925e652ec5e92aba1cf7b762886981c2d3f73006a36c3b564555e3989216b7a5","capture":{"method":"http-get"},"extraction":{"method":"verbatim","extractor":"public source capture text view","quote_binding":"exact-substring"},"as_of":"2026-10-12","derived_from":[],"review":{"status":"unreviewed","reviewed_at":null,"reviewer_role":"content reviewer","note":""},"reuse":{"basis":"public-record","note":"Cited and paraphrased; not republished in full."}}}]}},{"id":"edb62207-4618-59ce-a671-a497063e171f","payload":{"kind":"mini_lesson","locale":"es","locale_state":"reviewed","title":"¿Acudo al DLR o a la NLRB?","body":"Depende de su empleador. Si trabaja para el estado, un condado, una ciudad o pueblo, u otro empleador público de Massachusetts, sus derechos laborales vienen de la ley c. 150E y los cargos se presentan ante el Departamento de Relaciones Laborales de Massachusetts (DLR). La National Labor Relations Act no cubre a los empleadores del gobierno estatal o local. La Junta Nacional de Relaciones Laborales (NLRB) es la agencia federal para la mayoría de los trabajadores del sector privado, y su jurisdicción cubre a la gran mayoría de los empleadores que no son del gobierno. Algunos empleadores privados, sindicatos o trabajadores representados pueden presentar cargos ante el DLR. Si no está seguro, pregunte a su delegado o delegada sindical o comuníquese con cualquiera de las dos agencias.","attribution":"","source":"Massachusetts Department of Labor Relations (mass.gov), Public sector unfair labor practice charge, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.mass.gov/how-to/public-sector-unfair-labor-practice-charge); Massachusetts Trial Court Law Libraries (mass.gov), Massachusetts law about unions and collective bargaining, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.mass.gov/info-details/massachusetts-law-about-unions-and-collective-bargaining); Legal Information Institute, Cornell Law School (law.cornell.edu), 29 U.S. Code 152 - Definitions (NLRA), consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/29/152); Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov), M.G.L. c. 150E, section 1, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section1); National Labor Relations Board (nlrb.gov), Jurisdictional Standards, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.nlrb.gov/about-nlrb/rights-we-protect/the-law/jurisdictional-standards)","rights_note":"owner-authored: Original plain-language text drafted for the platform; statutes, regulations, agency pages and court opinions are cited and paraphrased, short quotations only.","review_note":"source review, 2026-10-12T07:41:37Z: Fresh-context verification pass: every claim read against its verbatim source quotes in context, Spanish checked against English, jurisdiction and affiliation guardrails checked. Not yet reviewed by the platform editor; editor review is required before publication.","bullets":[],"direction":"","topics":["faq","the-board"],"audience":"all","tone":"","learning_outcome":"","factual_claims":true,"priority":0,"is_default":false},"provenance":{"content_path":"content/explainer-content/faq.json","unit_id":"faq-dlr-or-nlrb","locale":"es","record":{"provenance_id":"prov-81d8cab01193530c917a80b46d71449daaaac55a67fb97777e935d386c30001a","source":{"url":"https://app.example.invalid/#faq-dlr-or-nlrb","publisher":"Union Ground platform content (authored draft)","title":"Do I go to the DLR or the NLRB?","document_date":"2