bor organizations","document_date":null},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:05:57Z","content_sha256":"fbbc5d6b424aac107445ef5fed5e792fd59f0e2b96b3b87f0063b696b1af5228","capture":{"method":"http-get"},"extraction":{"method":"verbatim","extractor":"public source capture text view","quote_binding":"exact-substring"},"as_of":"2026-10-12","derived_from":[],"review":{"status":"unreviewed","reviewed_at":null,"reviewer_role":"content reviewer","note":""},"reuse":{"basis":"public-record","note":"Cited and paraphrased; not republished in full."}}},{"source_key":"ma-150e-s7","provenance":{"provenance_id":"prov-9ff70d90b04e4d4b84d074f2379281256c7d263dd1786e950bee8180dc12ab6c","source":{"url":"https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section7","publisher":"Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov)","title":"M.G.L. c. 150E, section 7","document_date":null},"retrieved_at":"2026-10-12T07:04:39Z","content_sha256":"79bd21e29442b6264292d5e9ab5b8c01075862c03bd3ac24ad0daa34520f21d7","capture":{"method":"http-get"},"extraction":{"method":"verbatim","extractor":"public source capture text view","quote_binding":"exact-substring"},"as_of":"2026-10-12","derived_from":[],"review":{"status":"unreviewed","reviewed_at":null,"reviewer_role":"content reviewer","note":""},"reuse":{"basis":"public-record","note":"Cited and paraphrased; not republished in full."}}}]}},{"id":"8e649f0b-4c32-5fbc-a8d7-f6bbf7abb6ca","payload":{"kind":"mini_lesson","locale":"es","locale_state":"reviewed","title":"¿Cómo consigo una copia de mi contrato o de los estatutos de mi sindicato?","body":"Empiece por pedirlo a su delegado o delegada sindical o a la oficina del sindicato. En los sindicatos cubiertos por la ley federal Labor-Management Reporting and Disclosure Act (LMRDA), el secretario del sindicato local debe enviar una copia del contrato a cualquier empleado cuyos derechos se vean directamente afectados y que la pida, y los sindicatos cubiertos deben presentar su constitución y estatutos ante el Departamento de Trabajo de EE. UU., donde puede encontrarlos en la Sala de Divulgación Pública en línea de la OLMS. En el empleo público de Massachusetts, el empleador debe presentar cada contrato firmado ante el estado y ante los comités de finanzas (ways and means) de la Legislatura. También puede enviar una solicitud de registros públicos al Departamento de Relaciones Laborales (DLR).","attribution":"","source":"Massachusetts Department of Labor Relations (mass.gov), Public sector unfair labor practice charge, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.mass.gov/how-to/public-sector-unfair-labor-practice-charge); Legal Information Institute, Cornell Law School (law.cornell.edu), 29 U.S. Code 414 - Right to copies of collective bargaining agreements, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/29/414); U.S. Department of Labor, Office of Labor-Management Standards (dol.gov), OLMS Online Public Disclosure Room, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.dol.gov/agencies/olms/public-disclosure-room); Legal Information Institute, Cornell Law School (law.cornell.edu), 29 U.S. Code 431 - Report of labor organizations, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/29/431); Massachusetts General Court (malegislature.gov), M.G.L. c. 150E, section 7, consultada el 12 oct 2026 (https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXXI/Chapter150E/Section7)","rights_note":"owner-authored: Original plain-language text drafted for the platform; statutes, regulations, agency pages and court opinions are cited and paraphrased, short quotations only.","review_note":"source review, 2026-10-12T07:41:37Z: Fresh-context verification pass: every claim read against its verbatim source quotes in context, Spanish checked against English, jurisdiction and affiliation guardrails checked. Not yet reviewed by the platform editor; editor review is required before publication.","bullets":[],"direction":"","topics":["faq","union-democracy"],"audien